{
  "$schema": "../../case.schema.json",
  "suite": "agent-calls",
  "case": "authorize-api-errors",
  "description": "An authorize the API answers with an error: a 401, or a 403 with no code or with environment_mismatch (SolvaPay did not accept the agent), refuses as agent_not_accepted. A 403 with any other code refuses the merchant, not the agent (feature_not_enabled: agent payments are off; key_env_mismatch: the secret key is for the other environment), so it refuses as unavailable, as every other status does; never let through. Each logs call.authorize_failed with the status.",
